stateDiagram-v2
  direction TB
  [*] --> Selecting
  Selecting --> Bound : Bind [runtime up]
  Bound --> Serving : Serve [boot matches]
  Bound --> Settled : Refuse [boot changed]
  Bound --> Retiring : ExpireGrace [boot ended]
  Serving --> Retiring : ExpireGrace [boot ended]
  Serving --> Settled : Finish [user down]
  Retiring --> Settled : OwnerCleanup
  Settled --> [*]

  note right of Selecting
    Recover the old boot.
    Bind after admission.
  end note
  note right of Retiring
    INV NoStaleCleanup
    Stop only the graph
    of the watched boot.
  end note

  classDef live stroke-width:1.6px
  classDef wait stroke-width:1.6px
  classDef ok stroke-width:1.6px
  classDef idle stroke-width:1.6px
  class Selecting idle
  class Bound,Retiring wait
